       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115ICT0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Sys_Charge_Type.  00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      *                                                                 00210000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220000
      *                                                                 00230000
      *    Initialize                          R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 00240000
      *    Set   R115ICT0-Version        To    True                     00250000
      *    Set   R115ICT0-In-Select      To    True                     00260000
      *    Move  &charge-type            To    R115ICT0-In-CT-Type      00270000
      *    Move  &regno                  To    R115ICT0-In-Regno        00271016
      *                                                                 00280000
      *    Call  'F115ICT0'              Using R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 00290000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00300000
      *    End-Call                                                     00310000
      *                                                                 00320000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00330000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00340000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00350000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00360000
      *                                                                 00370000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00380000
      *        ...not found...                                          00390000
      *                                                                 00400000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00410000
      *        ...found...                                              00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00440000
      *                                                                 00450000
      *################################################################*00460000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00470000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00480000
      *200813!NDL! Added new GAR-account                         !LO18! 00490021
      *230801!NDL! Added Regno and GL-E-Coll-Acc                 !LO18! 00490121
      *230401!NDL! Added Read-POP, Paying-Pty                    !LT12! 00490221
      *050101!NDL! Removed Paying_Pty, Min_Max, added Sort       !LT12! 00490321
      *160800!NDL! Added split-pct                               !LR02! 00490421
      *190399!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00491013
      *################################################################*00500000
       Environment Division.                                            00510000
       Configuration Section.                                           00520000
       Special-Names.                                                   00530000
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00540000
      *                                                                 00550000
      *################################################################*00560000
       Data Division.                                                   00570000
       Working-Storage Section.                                         00580000
      *                                                                 00590000
       01  Filler.                                                      00600000
      *                                                                 00610000
           05  W-Table-Name              Pic  X(18) Value               00620000
                                                   'TF_Sys_Charge_Type'.00630000
      *                                                                 00640000
           05  W-IO-Length               Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00650000
           05  W-Tally                   Pic S9(05)              Comp.  00660009
      *                                                                 00670000
           05  WD-Length                 Pic  Z.ZZ9.                    00680000
           05  WD-Fin-Inst-Id            Pic  9(18).                    00690003
      *                                                                 00700000
           05  Ind-WS-Put                Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00710000
           05  Ind-WS                    Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00720000
           05  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab          Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00730000
      *                                                                 00740000
      *    This field is needed because of the old interfaces used to   00750003
      *    access Fin-Inst-ID and Customer ID.                          00760003
           05  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr          Pic  9(04).                    00770003
      *                                                                 00780003
           05  Filler.                                                  00790003
               10  W-Fin-Inst-No         Pic  X(18).                    00800003
               10  W-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic  9(18)              Comp-3.00810003
      *                                                                 00820003
               10  WD-Regno              Pic  zzz9.                     00822020
      *                                                                 00830003
           05  W-Input-Action            Pic  X(10).                    00840000
             88  SW-IA-Initialize                   Value 'INITIALIZE'. 00850000
      *                                                                 00860000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00870000
      * Counters, used on cursor read, to return row no. and total      00880000
      * no. of rows.                                                    00890000
      * Total no. of rows is only returned when -In-Count is set on     00900000
      * the Get-1st-call.                                               00910000
      *                                                                 00920000
           05  WC-Counters.                                             00930000
               10  WC-Row-No             Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.00940000
               10  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows   Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.00950000
      *                                                                 00960000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00970000
      * Switches used for selecting the correct cursor:                 00980000
      *                                                                 00990000
           05  SW-Cursor-Code.                                          01000000
               10  SW-CC-Fin-Inst        Pic  X(01).                    01010003
                 88  SW-Use-Fi                      Value 'F'.          01020003
               10  SW-CC-Type            Pic  X(01).                    01030003
                 88  SW-Use-Type                    Value 'T'.          01040003
               10  SW-CC-Regno           Pic  X(01).                    01041016
                 88  SW-Use-Regno                   Value 'R'.          01042016
      *                                                                 01050000
           05  Filler                    Redefines SW-Cursor-Code       01060000
                                         Pic  X(03).                    01070016
             88  SW-Use-Asc                         Value '   '.        01080016
             88  SW-Use-Ty-Asc                      Value ' T '.        01090016
             88  SW-Use-Fi-Ty-Asc                   Value 'FT '.        01100016
             88  SW-Use-Fi-Ty-Re-Asc                Value 'FTR'.        01101016
      *                                                                 01110000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01120000
      * These fields are used for SQL qualification:                    01130000
      *                                                                 01140000
           05  W-DB-Key.                                                01150000
               10  W-DB-Type             Pic  X(20).                    01160000
               10  W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id      Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01170003
               10  W-DB-Regno            Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01171017
      *                                                                 01180000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01190000
      * These fields are used for comparison with the WS-fields.        01200000
      *                                                                 01210000
           05  WE-Cursor-Info.                                          01220000
             07  WE-Key.                                                01230000
               10  WE-Type               Pic  X(20).                    01240000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-Id        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01250003
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01260003
               10  WE-Regno              Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01261017
             07  WE-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01270000
               88  WE-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01280000
               88  WE-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01290000
      *                                                                 01300000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01310000
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01320000
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01330000
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01340000
      *                                                                 01350000
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01360000
      *                                                                 01370000
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01380000
             07  WS-Key.                                                01390000
               10  WS-Type               Pic  X(20).                    01400000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-Id        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01410003
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01420003
               10  WS-Regno              Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01421017
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01430000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01440000
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01450000
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    01460000
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         01470000
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        01480000
      *                                                                 01490000
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    01500000
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         01510000
      *                                                                 01520000
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            01530000
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               01540000
               10  WS-DB2-Type           Pic  X(20).                    01550000
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01560003
               10  WS-DB2-Regno          Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01561019
               10  WS-DB2-Row-Status     Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01570000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           01580000
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           01590000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           01600000
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(384).                   01610012
      *                                                                 01620000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01630000
      * Areas for use when accessing DB2.                               01640000
      *                                                                 01650000
           Exec SQL Include R115TFCT End-Exec.                          01660000
      *                                                                 01670000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01680000
      * Internal area:                                                  01690000
      *                                                                 01700000
       01  W-Int-IO-Area.                                               01710000
           Copy R115ICT0.                                               01720000
      *                                                                 01730000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01740000
      * Assorted copy-areas:                                            01750000
      *                                                                 01760000
       01  Filler.                                                      01770000
           Copy R115ICTS.                                               01780000
      *                                                                 01790000
       01  Filler.                                                      01800000
           Copy R5879010.                                               01810000
      *                                                                 01820000
       01  Filler.                                                      01830000
           Copy R7918030.                                               01840000
      *                                                                 01850000
       Copy R7919100.                                                   01860000
      *                                                                 01870000
       Copy R115X000.                                                   01880000
      *                                                                 01890000
      *################################################################.01900000
       Linkage Section.                                                 01910000
      *                                                                 01920000
       01  L-Ext-IO-Area                 Pic  X(560).                   01930000
       Copy R7919999.                                                   01940000
      *                                                                 01950000
      *################################################################.01960000
       Procedure Division                Using L-Ext-IO-Area            01970000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area.     01980000
      *                                                                 01990000
       A000-Main                         Section.                       02000000
      *                                                                 02010000
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      02020000
      *                                                                 02030000
           Evaluate True                                                02040000
             When SW-IA-Initialize                                      02050000
               Continue                                                 02060000
      *                                                                 02070000
             When Other                                                 02080000
               Perform ZI00-Conv-Input-Version                          02090000
               Perform C000-Interface                                   02100000
               Perform ZO00-Conv-Output-Version                         02110000
      *                                                                 02120000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02130000
      *                                                                 02140000
           Goback.                                                      02150000
      *################################################################*02160000
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02170000
      *                                                                 02180000
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02190000
      *                                                                 02200000
           Evaluate True                                                02210000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02220000
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02230000
             When Other                                                 02240000
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           02250000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02260000
      *                                                                 02270000
           Compute  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab                                    02280000
               =    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Table             02290000
               /    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Row               02300000
      *                                                                 02310000
           If  Sw-IA-Initialize                                         02320000
           or  WS-DB2-Row-Status (1)     Not   Numeric                  02330000
               Initialize                      W-Storage                02340000
               Move  +0                  To    Ind-WS-Put               02350000
           End-If                                                       02360000
      *                                                                 02370000
           If  WC-Row-No                 Not   Numeric                  02380000
           or  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows       Not   Numeric                  02390000
               Initialize                      WC-Counters              02400000
           End-If                                                       02410000
      *                                                                 02420000
           Evaluate True                                                02430000
             When Not R115X000-Is-Initiated                             02440000
               Initialize                      R115X000-External-Data   02450000
             When Not R115X000-Version                                  02460000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    02470000
               Move  'GL-VERSION-INVALID'                               02480000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  02490000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)02500000
               Move  R115X000-Version-No To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)02510000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)02520000
               Move  'R115X000'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)02530000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               02540000
               Move  'B001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02550000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02560000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02570000
      *                                                                 02580000
           .                                                            02590000
      *################################################################.02600000
       C000-Interface                    Section.                       02610000
      *                                                                 02620000
           Evaluate True                                                02630000
             When R115ICT0-In-Get-1st                                   02640000
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           02650000
               Perform D000-Get-1st                                     02660000
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    02670000
      *                                                                 02680000
             When R115ICT0-In-Get-Next                                  02690000
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           02700000
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    02710000
      *                                                                 02720000
             When R115ICT0-In-Select                                    02730000
               Perform C100-Initialize-Output                           02740000
               Perform F000-Select                                      02750000
      *                                                                 02760000
             When R115ICT0-In-Insert                                    02770000
               Perform G000-Insert                                      02780000
      *                                                                 02790000
             When R115ICT0-In-Update                                    02800000
               Perform H000-Update                                      02810000
      *                                                                 02820000
             When R115ICT0-In-Delete                                    02830000
               Perform I000-Delete                                      02840000
      *                                                                 02850000
             When Other                                                 02860000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    02870000
               Move  'GL-IN-AKSJON-UV'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  02880000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)02890000
               Move  R115ICT0-In-Action  To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)02900000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               02910000
               Move  'C001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02920000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02930000
      *                                                                 02940000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02950000
      *                                                                 02960000
           .                                                            02970000
      *################################################################.02980000
       C100-Initialize-Output            Section.                       02990000
      *                                                                 03000000
           Initialize                          R115ICT0-Data            03010000
      *                                                                 03020000
           .                                                            03030000
      *################################################################.03040000
       D000-Get-1st                      Section.                       03050000
      *                                                                 03060000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   03070000
           Perform D200-Prepare-Qualification                           03080000
           Perform D300-Select-Cursor                                   03090000
           If  R115ICT0-In-CC-Count                                     03100000
               Perform D400-Count-Cursor                                03110000
           End-If                                                       03120000
           Perform D500-Open-Cursor                                     03130000
      *                                                                 03140000
           .                                                            03150000
      *################################################################.03160000
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       03170000
      *                                                                 03180000
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 03190000
      *                                                                 03200000
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           03210000
      *                                                                 03220000
           Move  R115ICT0-In-CT-Type     To    WE-Type                  03230000
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  03240009
           Inspect WE-Type              Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'03250009
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       03260009
               Inspect WE-Type           Converting '* ' to '%%'        03270009
           End-If                                                       03280009
      *                                                                 03290000
           Move  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-Id To    WE-Fin-Inst-Id           03300003
           Move  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No To    WE-Fin-Inst-No           03310003
      *                                                                 03320003
           Move  R115ICT0-In-Regno       To    WE-Regno                 03321017
           .                                                            03330000
      *################################################################.03340000
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       03350000
      *                                                                 03360000
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       03370000
      * qualification do not change on any following Get-Next.          03380000
      *                                                                 03390000
           Initialize                          WS-Cursor-Info           03400000
           Move  WE-Key                  To    WS-Key                   03410000
           Move  WE-Code-Sequence        To    WS-Code-Sequence         03420000
      *                                                                 03430000
           Initialize WC-Counters                                       03440000
      *                                                                 03450000
      * We fill in the SQL host variables.                              03460000
      *                                                                 03470000
           Initialize                          W-DB-Key                 03480000
      *                                                                 03490000
           Move  WE-Type                 To    W-DB-Type                03500000
           Move  WE-Regno                To    W-DB-Regno               03501017
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-Id          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id         03510003
      *                                                                 03520003
           If  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No   Not = Space                    03530003
           and R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-ID   =     +0                       03540003
               Move  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            03550003
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            03560003
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           03570003
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id         03580003
           End-If                                                       03590003
      *                                                                 03600003
           .                                                            03610000
      *################################################################.03620000
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       03630000
      *                                                                 03640000
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  03650000
      *                                                                 03660000
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           03670000
      *                                                                 03680000
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-Id          Not = +0                       03690003
               Set  Sw-Use-FI            To    True                     03700003
           End-If                                                       03710000
      *                                                                 03720003
           If  W-DB-Type                 Not = Space                    03730003
           and W-DB-Type (1:1)           Not = '%'                      03740003
               Set  Sw-Use-Type          To    True                     03750003
           End-If                                                       03760003
      *                                                                 03761017
      *    If  W-DB-Regno                Not = +0                       03762017
      *    Allways qualify on regno                                     03763017
               Set  Sw-Use-Regno         To    True                     03764017
      *    End-If                                                       03765017
      *                                                                 03770000
           Evaluate True                                                03780000
             When SW-Use-Asc                                            03790000
             or   SW-Use-Ty-Asc                                         03800000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Ty-Asc                                      03810003
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Ty-Re-Asc                                   03811018
               Continue                                                 03820000
      *                                                                 03830000
             When other                                                 03840000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    03850000
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03860000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03870000
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03880000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03890000
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03900000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03910000
      *                                                                 03920000
           End-Evaluate                                                 03930000
      *                                                                 03940000
           .                                                            03950000
      *################################################################.03960000
       D400-Count-Cursor                 Section.                       03970000
      *                                                                 03980000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  03990000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     04000000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Count-Cursor                               04010000
                                         To    True                     04020000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICTS-Cursor-Code     04030000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICTS-DB-Key          04040000
      *                                                                 04050000
           Call  'F115ICTR'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  04060000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    04070000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      04080000
           End-Call                                                     04090000
      *                                                                 04100000
           Evaluate True                                                04110000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    04120000
               Move  R115ICTS-Out-Total-Rows                            04130000
                                         To    WC-Total-No-Of-Rows      04140000
      *                                                                 04150000
             When other                                                 04160000
               Move  'D401'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04170000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04180000
      *                                                                 04190000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04200000
      *                                                                 04210000
           .                                                            04220000
      *################################################################.04230000
       D500-Open-Cursor                  Section.                       04240000
      *                                                                 04250000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  04260000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     04270000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Open-Cursor To    True                     04280000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICTS-Cursor-Code     04290000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICTS-DB-Key          04300000
      *                                                                 04310000
           Call  'F115ICTR'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  04320000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    04330000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      04340000
           End-Call                                                     04350000
      *                                                                 04360000
           Evaluate True                                                04370000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    04380000
               Set   WS-Cursor-OK        To    True                     04390000
      *                                                                 04400000
             When other                                                 04410000
               Move  'D501'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04420000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04430000
      *                                                                 04440000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04450000
      *                                                                 04460000
           .                                                            04470000
      *################################################################.04480000
       E000-Get-Next                     Section.                       04490000
      *                                                                 04500000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   04510000
           Perform E100-Check-Qualification                             04520000
           Perform E200-Fetch-Cursor                                    04530000
      *                                                                 04540000
           If  R7919999-Return-OK                                       04550000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   04560000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 04570000
           End-If                                                       04580000
      *                                                                 04590000
           .                                                            04600000
      *################################################################.04610000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       04620000
      *                                                                 04630000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         04640000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     04650000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    04660000
      *                                                                 04670000
           Evaluate True                                                04680000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   04690000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         04700000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          04710000
               Continue                                                 04720000
      *                                                                 04730000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   04740000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         04750000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         04760000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    04770000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  04780000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)04790000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)04800000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               04810000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04820000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04830000
      *                                                                 04840000
             When Other                                                 04850000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    04860000
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  04870000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               04880000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04890000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04900000
      *                                                                 04910000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04920000
      *                                                                 04930000
           .                                                            04940000
      *################################################################.04950000
       E200-Fetch-Cursor                 Section.                       04960000
      *                                                                 04970000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  04980000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     04990000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               05000000
                                         To    True                     05010000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICTS-Cursor-Code     05020000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICTS-DB-Key          05030000
      *                                                                 05040000
           Call  'F115ICTR'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  05050000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    05060000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      05070000
           End-Call                                                     05080000
      *                                                                 05090000
           Evaluate True                                                05100000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    05110000
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                05120000
      *                                                                 05130000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 05140000
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     05150000
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       05160000
                 Then                                                   05170000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    05180000
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              05190000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05200000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05210000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05220000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           05230000
                 Else                                                   05240000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    05250000
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05260000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05270000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05280000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           05290000
               End-If                                                   05300000
      *                                                                 05310000
             When other                                                 05320000
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05330000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05340000
      *                                                                 05350000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05360000
      *                                                                 05370000
           .                                                            05380000
      *################################################################.05390000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       05400000
      *                                                                 05410000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           05420000
      *                                                                 05430000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       05440000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               05450000
      *                                                                 05460000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        05470000
      *                                                                 05480000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     05490000
      *                                                                 05500000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         05510000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 05520000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  05530000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   05540000
           End-If                                                       05550000
      *                                                                 05560000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       05570000
      *                                                                 05580000
           Evaluate True                                                05590000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  05600000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    05610000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 05620000
      *                                                                 05630000
             When other                                                 05640000
               Move  FK-OAKO-FININST-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-Id              05650003
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05660000
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05670000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05680000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05690000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)05700000
               Move  TFCT-Regno          To WD-Regno                    05701020
               String TFCT-Type                Delimited by size        05710000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        05720003
                      WD-Fin-Inst-Id           Delimited by size        05730003
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        05731017
                      WD-Regno                 Delimited by size        05732020
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)05740000
               End-String                                               05750000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05760000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              05770000
                                         To    True                     05780000
      *                                                                 05790000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05800000
      *                                                                 05810000
           .                                                            05820000
      *################################################################.05830000
       F100-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       05840000
      *                                                                 05850000
      * We fill in the host variables for the SQL.                      05860000
      *                                                                 05870000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    05880000
      *                                                                 05890000
           Move  R115ICT0-In-CT-Type     To    TFCT-Type                05900000
           Move  R115ICT0-In-Regno       To    TFCT-Regno               05901016
           Move  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-Id To    FK-OAKO-FININST-ID       05910003
      *                                                                 05920000
           If  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No   Not = Space                    05930003
           and FK-OAKO-FININST-ID        =     +0                       05940003
               Move  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            05950003
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            05960003
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           05970003
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FININST-ID       05980003
           End-If                                                       05990003
      *                                                                 06000003
           .                                                            06010000
      *################################################################.06020000
       F200-Select-Row                   Section.                       06030000
      *                                                                 06040000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  06050000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     06060000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Select      To    True                     06070000
      *                                                                 06080000
           Call  'F115ICTR'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  06090000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    06100000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06110000
           End-Call                                                     06120000
      *                                                                 06130000
           Evaluate True                                                06140000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06150000
               Continue                                                 06160000
      *                                                                 06170000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 06180000
               Continue                                                 06190000
      *                                                                 06200000
             When other                                                 06210000
               Move  'F201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06220000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06230000
      *                                                                 06240000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06250000
      *                                                                 06260000
           .                                                            06270000
      *################################################################.06280000
       G000-Insert                       Section.                       06290000
      *                                                                 06300000
           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               06310000
           Perform G200-Insert-Row                                      06320000
      *                                                                 06330000
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      06340000
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       06350000
      *                                                                 06360000
           .                                                            06370000
      *################################################################.06380000
       G100-Move-Input-To-DCL            Section.                       06390000
      *                                                                 06400000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    06410000
      *                                                                 06420000
           Move R115ICT0-CT-Type         To    TFCT-Type                06430000
           Move R115ICT0-Regno           To    TFCT-Regno               06431016
           Move R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-Id     To    FK-OAKO-FININST-ID       06440003
      *                                                                 06450003
           If  R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-No  Not = Space                        06460008
           and FK-OAKO-FININST-ID        =     +0                       06470003
               Move  R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-No                               06480008
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            06490003
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           06500003
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FININST-ID       06510003
           End-If                                                       06520003
      *                                                                 06530000
           Move R115ICT0-Description     To    TFCT-Description         06540000
           Move R115ICT0-Method-Calc     To    TFCT-METHOD-CALC         06550004
           Move R115ICT0-Sort            To    TFCT-Sort                06560014
      *    Move R115ICT0-Paying-Party    To    FK-TFRP-PAYING-PTY       06570014
           Move R115ICT0-Credit          To    TFCT-CREDIT              06580004
      *    Move R115ICT0-Min-Max         To    TFCT-MIN-MAX             06590014
           Move R115ICT0-PPFT-Code       To    FK-PPFT-CODE             06600004
           Move R115ICT0-GL-Coll-Acc     To    TFCT-GL-Coll-Acc         06610011
           Move R115ICT0-GL-E-Coll-Acc   To    TFCT-GL-E-Coll-Acc       06611016
           Move R115ICT0-Branch-Code     To    TFCT-Branch-Code         06620010
           Move R115ICT0-GL-ELC-Acc      To    TFCT-GL-ELC-Acc          06630011
           Move R115ICT0-GL-ILC-Acc      To    TFCT-GL-ILC-Acc          06640011
           Move R115ICT0-Split-Pct       To    TFCT-Split-Pct           06641013
           Move R115ICT0-Read-POP        To    TFCT-Read-POP            06642015
           Move R115ICT0-Paying-Pty      To    TFCT-Paying-Pty          06643015
           Move R115ICT0-GL-GAR-Acc      To    TFCT-GL-GAR-Acc          06644021
      *                                                                 06650000
           .                                                            06660000
      *################################################################.06670000
       G200-Insert-Row                   Section.                       06680000
      *                                                                 06690000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  06700000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     06710000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Insert      To    True                     06720000
      *                                                                 06730000
           Call  'F115ICTU'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  06740000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    06750000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06760000
           End-Call                                                     06770000
      *                                                                 06780000
           Evaluate True                                                06790000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06800000
               Continue                                                 06810000
      *                                                                 06820000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 06830000
               Continue                                                 06840000
      *                                                                 06850000
             When other                                                 06860000
               Move  'G201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06870000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06880000
      *                                                                 06890000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06900000
      *                                                                 06910000
           .                                                            06920000
      *################################################################.06930000
       H000-Update                       Section.                       06940000
      *                                                                 06950000
           Perform H100-Check-Qualification                             06960000
           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               06970000
      *                                                                 06980000
           Perform H200-Update-Row                                      06990000
      *                                                                 07000000
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      07010000
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       07020000
      *                                                                 07030000
           .                                                            07040000
      *################################################################.07050000
       H100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       07060000
      *                                                                 07070000
           Evaluate True                                                07080000
             When R115ICT0-CT-Type       Not = Space                    07090000
               Continue                                                 07100000
                                                                        07110000
             When R115ICT0-In-CT-Type    Not = Space                    07120000
               Move R115ICT0-In-CT-Type  To    R115ICT0-CT-Type         07130000
                                                                        07140003
             When other                                                 07150000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    07160000
               Move  'TF-TYPE-MISSING'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07170000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               07180000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              07190000
                                         To    True                     07200000
                                                                        07210000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07220000
      *                                                                 07230003
           Evaluate True                                                07240003
             When R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-Id   Not = +0                       07250003
               Continue                                                 07260003
                                                                        07270003
             When R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-Id                               07280003
                                         Not = +0                       07290003
               Move R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-Id                             07300003
                                         To    R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-Id     07310003
                                                                        07320003
             When R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-No   Not = +0                       07330003
               Move  R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-No                               07340005
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            07350003
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           07360003
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-Id     07370003
                                                                        07380003
                                                                        07390003
             When R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No                               07400003
                                         Not = +0                       07410003
               Move  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            07420007
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            07430003
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           07440003
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-Id     07450003
                                                                        07460003
             When other                                                 07470003
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    07480003
               Move  'TF-FININST-MISSING'                               07490003
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07500003
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               07510003
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              07520003
                                         To    True                     07530003
                                                                        07540003
           End-Evaluate                                                 07550003
      *                                                                 07560000
           .                                                            07570000
      *################################################################.07580000
       H200-Update-Row                   Section.                       07590000
      *                                                                 07600000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  07610000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     07620000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Update      To    True                     07630000
      *                                                                 07640000
           Call  'F115ICTU'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  07650000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    07660000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07670000
           End-Call                                                     07680000
      *                                                                 07690000
           Evaluate True                                                07700000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07710000
               Continue                                                 07720000
      *                                                                 07730000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07740000
               Continue                                                 07750000
      *                                                                 07760000
             When other                                                 07770000
               Move  'H201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07780000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07790000
      *                                                                 07800000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07810000
      *                                                                 07820000
           .                                                            07830000
      *################################################################.07840000
       I000-Delete                       Section.                       07850000
      *                                                                 07860000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           07870000
           Perform I200-Delete-Row                                      07880000
      *                                                                 07890000
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      07900000
      *                                                                 07910000
           .                                                            07920000
      *################################################################.07930000
       I200-Delete-Row                   Section.                       07940000
      *                                                                 07950000
           Initialize                          R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  07960000
           Set   R115ICTS-Version        To    True                     07970000
           Set   R115ICTS-In-Delete      To    True                     07980000
      *                                                                 07990000
           Call  'F115ICTU'              Using R115ICTS-SQL-Submodules  08000000
                                               DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    08010000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      08020000
           End-Call                                                     08030000
      *                                                                 08040000
           Evaluate True                                                08050000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    08060000
               Continue                                                 08070000
      *                                                                 08080000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 08090000
               Continue                                                 08100000
      *                                                                 08110000
             When other                                                 08120000
               Move  'I201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       08130000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       08140000
      *                                                                 08150000
           End-Evaluate                                                 08160000
      *                                                                 08170000
           .                                                            08180000
      *################################################################.08190000
       J000-Get-Columns                  Section.                       08200000
      *                                                                 08210000
           Perform J100-Move-DCL-To-Output                              08220000
      *                                                                 08230000
           .                                                            08240000
      *################################################################.08250000
       J100-Move-DCL-To-Output           Section.                       08260000
      *                                                                 08270000
           Move  TFCT-Type               To    R115ICT0-CT-Type         08280000
           Move  TFCT-Regno              To    R115ICT0-Regno           08281016
           Move  FK-OAKO-FININST-ID      To    R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-Id     08290003
      *                                                                 08300000
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            08310003
           Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                               08320003
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No           To    R115ICT0-Fin-Inst-No     08330003
      *                                                                 08340003
           Move  TFCT-Description        To    R115ICT0-Description     08350000
           Move  TFCT-Method-Calc        To    R115ICT0-Method-Calc     08360010
           Move  TFCT-Sort               To    R115ICT0-Sort            08370014
      *    Move  FK-TFRP-Paying-Pty      To    R115ICT0-Paying-Party    08380014
           Move  TFCT-Credit             To    R115ICT0-Credit          08390010
      *    Move  TFCT-Min-Max            To    R115ICT0-Min-Max         08400014
           Move  FK-PPFT-Code            To    R115ICT0-PPFT-Code       08410010
           Move  TFCT-GL-E-Coll-Acc      To    R115ICT0-GL-E-Coll-Acc   08420016
           Move  TFCT-GL-Coll-Acc        To    R115ICT0-GL-Coll-Acc     08421016
           Move  TFCT-Branch-Code        To    R115ICT0-Branch-Code     08430010
           Move  TFCT-GL-ELC-Acc         To    R115ICT0-GL-ELC-Acc      08440011
           Move  TFCT-GL-ILC-Acc         To    R115ICT0-GL-ILC-Acc      08450011
           Move  TFCT-Split-Pct          To    R115ICT0-Split-Pct       08451013
           Move  TFCT-Read-POP           To    R115ICT0-Read-POP        08452015
           Move  TFCT-Paying-Pty         To    R115ICT0-Paying-Pty      08453015
           Move  TFCT-GL-GAR-Acc         To    R115ICT0-GL-GAR-Acc      08454021
      *                                                                 08460002
      * Info about the cursor:                                          08470000
      *                                                                 08480000
           Move  WC-Row-No               To    R115ICT0-Out-Row-No      08490000
           Move  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows     To    R115ICT0-Out-Total-Rows  08500000
      *                                                                 08510000
           .                                                            08520000
      *################################################################.08530000
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       08540000
      *                                                                 08550000
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      08560001
      *                                                                 08570001
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        08580001
      *                                                                 08590001
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         08600001
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 08610001
             Then                                                       08620001
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         08630001
      *        we start on the beginning.                               08640001
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       08650001
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               08660001
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         08670001
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               08680001
               End-If                                                   08690001
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   08700001
             Else                                                       08710001
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               08720001
           End-If                                                       08730001
      *                                                                 08740001
      * We store the identification.                                    08750000
      *                                                                 08760000
           Move  TFCT-Type               To    WS-DB2-Type  (Ind-WS-Put)08770000
           Move  TFCT-Regno              To    WS-DB2-Regno (Ind-WS-Put)08771016
           Move  FK-OAKO-FININST-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id       08780003
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)08790003
      *                                                                 08800000
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  08810000
      *                                                                 08820000
           Evaluate True                                                08830000
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    08840000
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               08850000
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type    08860000
                                         To    WD-Length                08870000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    08880000
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  08890000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)08900000
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)08910000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               08920000
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       08930000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       08940000
      *                                                                 08950000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 08960000
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      08970000
                                         To    True                     08980000
      *                                                                 08990000
             When other                                                 09000000
               Move  DCLTF-Sys-Charge-Type                              09010000
                                         To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)09020000
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           09030000
                                         To    True                     09040000
      *                                                                 09050000
           End-Evaluate                                                 09060000
      *                                                                 09070000
           .                                                            09080000
      *################################################################.09090000
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       09100000
      *                                                                 09110000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       09120000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       09130000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         09140000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Type (Ind-WS)                           09150000
                                         =     TFCT-Type                09160003
                   and   WS-DB2-Regno (Ind-WS)                          09161016
                                         =     TFCT-Regno               09162016
                   and   WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id (Ind-WS)                    09170003
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FININST-ID )     09180003
           End-Perform                                                  09190000
      *                                                                 09200000
           .                                                            09210000
      *################################################################*09220000
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       09230000
      *                                                                 09240000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       09250000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       09260000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         09270000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Type (Ind-WS)                           09280000
                                         =     TFCT-Type                09290003
                   and   WS-DB2-Regno (Ind-WS)                          09300016
                                         =     TFCT-Regno               09310016
                   and   WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-Id (Ind-WS)                    09311016
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FININST-ID )     09312016
           End-Perform                                                  09320000
      *                                                                 09330000
           Evaluate True                                                09340000
             When Ind-WS                 >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         09350000
               Continue                                                 09360000
      *                                                                 09370000
             When other                                                 09380000
               Initialize                      WS-DB2-Row (Ind-WS)      09390000
      *                                                                 09400000
           End-Evaluate                                                 09410000
      *                                                                 09420000
           .                                                            09430000
      *################################################################*09440003
       N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID            Section.                       09450003
      *                                                                 09460003
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         09470003
      *                                                                 09480003
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     09490003
           or  R5879010-In-Konsernnr     Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         09500003
      *                                                                 09510003
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         09520003
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     09530003
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     09540003
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr    09550003
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         09560003
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      09570003
               End-Call                                                 09580003
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               09590003
                   Move  'N101'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       09600003
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   09610003
               End-If                                                   09620003
      *                                                                 09630003
           End-If                                                       09640003
      *                                                                 09650003
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id                              09660003
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            09670003
      *                                                                 09680003
           .                                                            09690003
      *################################################################*09700003
       N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No            Section.                       09710003
      *                                                                 09720003
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     09730003
           or  R5879010-In-Konsern-ID    Not = W-Fin-Inst-ID            09740003
      *                                                                 09750003
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         09760003
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     09770003
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     09780003
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R5879010-In-Konsern-ID   09790003
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         09800003
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      09810003
               End-Call                                                 09820003
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               09830003
                   Move  'N201'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       09840003
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   09850003
               End-If                                                   09860003
      *                                                                 09870003
           End-If                                                       09880003
      *                                                                 09890003
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsernnummer                           09900003
                                         To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         09910003
           Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr        To    W-Fin-Inst-No            09920003
      *                                                                 09930003
           .                                                            09940003
      *################################################################*09950000
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       09960000
      *                                                                 09970000
      * Version control.                                                09980000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         09990000
      *                                                                 10000000
           Set   R115ICT0-Version        To    True                     10010000
           Move  Length                  Of    R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 10020000
                                         To    W-IO-Length              10030000
      *                                                                 10040000
           Evaluate True                                                10050000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ICT0-Version-No      10060000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            10070000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              10080000
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      10090000
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            10100000
      *                                                                 10110000
             When Other                                                 10120000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         10130000
                   Using By Content      'F115ICT0 '                    10140000
                                         'INPUT '                       10150000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  10160000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  10170000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            10180000
               End-Call                                                 10190000
      *                                                                 10200000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                10210000
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       10220000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   10230000
               End-If                                                   10240000
      *                                                                 10250000
           End-Evaluate                                                 10260000
      *                                                                 10270000
           .                                                            10280000
      *################################################################*10290000
       ZO00-Conv-Output-Version          Section.                       10300000
      *                                                                 10310000
      * Version control.                                                10320000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         10330000
      *                                                                 10340000
           Evaluate True                                                10350000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ICT0-Version-No      10360000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            10370000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              10380000
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            10390000
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)10400000
      *                                                                 10410000
             When Other                                                 10420000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         10430000
                   Using By Content      'F115ICT0 '                    10440000
                                         'OUTPUT '                      10450000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  10460000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  10470000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            10480000
               End-Call                                                 10490000
      *                                                                 10500000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                10510000
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       10520000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   10530000
               End-If                                                   10540000
      *                                                                 10550000
           End-Evaluate                                                 10560000
      *                                                                 10570000
           .                                                            10580000
      *################################################################*10590000
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       10600000
      *                                                                 10610000
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     10620000
      *                                                                 10630000
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    10640000
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  10650000
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             10660000
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     10670000
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        10680000
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     10690000
           End-If                                                       10700000
      *                                                                 10710000
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    10720000
           End-Call                                                     10730000
      *                                                                 10740000
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               10750000
                                         To    R7919999-Message         10760000
      *                                                                 10770000
           .                                                            10780000
      *################################################################*10790000
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       10800000
      *                                                                 10810000
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  10820000
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                10830000
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      10840000
           End-If                                                       10850000
      *                                                                 10860000
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      10870000
      *                                                                 10880000
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          10890000
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      10900000
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )10910000
               Move  'F115ICT0'          To    R7919999-Module-Name     10920000
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)10930000
               Move  R7919999-Paragraph  To    R7919999-Module-Para     10940000
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)10950000
           End-If                                                       10960000
      *                                                                 10970000
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    TRUE                     10980000
      *                                                                 10990000
           Goback.                                                      11000000
